&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;Our comparative balance sheet statement for December 31, 202&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;5&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt; and 202&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;4&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt; included &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;$12.7&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;&amp;#160;million and $1&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;3&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;8&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt; million, respectively, for financing costs associated with the establishment of the U.S. Construction Facility in September 2008 and the U.S. Working Capital Facility in September 2010. For further discussion of these facilities, see Note 5 Debt.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; -aw-import: spaces;"&gt;&amp;#160; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;Financing costs related to these facilities have been included in our regulatory assets as we are allowed to recover all of the financing costs in establishing these facilities from our shippers as set forth in our settlement agreement with the FERC. Although the related facilities were terminated in 2014, the related financing costs are still recoverable under our settlement agreement with the FERC and will continue to be amortized over the life of the shipper contracts.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-weight: bold; font-style: italic;"&gt;Allowance for Equity Used During Construction &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;We have recognized regulatory assets in our comparative balance sheet statement, representing the amounts we are allowed to recover as set forth in our settlement agreement with the FERC, for the effect of income tax expenses we incurred in connection with the income recognized for the Allowance for Equity Used During Construction (AEDC) recorded for the Southern Lights Pipeline. Although we became a nontaxable entity in 2014, the related tax costs are still recoverable under our settlement agreement with the FERC and will continue to be amortized over the life of the shipper contracts. The regulatory assets were reduced at December 31, 2017 in the amount of $15.9 million to reflect the reduction in tax rate`s from the Tax Cuts and Jobs Act that was passed into law on December 22, 2017.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-weight: bold; font-style: italic;"&gt;Regulatory - Southern Lights Tariff Filing&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;During fiscal year 2025, Southern Lights&amp;#8217; committed and uncommitted transportation rates were governed by FERC&amp;#8209;filed tariffs. Rates effective January 1, 2025 were set out in FERC No. 4.24.0, with committed and uncommitted rates of approximately $3.8608/bbl and $7.7216/bbl, respectively.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;On May 29, 2025, Southern Lights filed an updated Local Rates tariff with the FERC, FERC No. 4.25.0 (cancelling FERC No. 4.24.0), which became effective July 1, 2025. Under FERC No. 4.25.0, the tariffed committed and uncommitted rates are $3.8608/bbl and $7.7216/bbl, respectively&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;5.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; -aw-import: spaces;"&gt;&amp;#160; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-weight: bold;"&gt;DEBT&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-weight: bold; font-style: italic;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-weight: bold; font-style: italic;"&gt;Senior Notes&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;In September 2008, we established a $1.17 billion non-revolving construction credit facility, known as the U.S. Construction Facility, with a group of lenders for the purpose of funding capital expenditures that are directly related to the Southern Lights Pipeline and to refinance the indebtedness already incurred to fund such costs.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; -aw-import: spaces;"&gt;&amp;#160; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;At December 31, 2013, we had $1,061.0 million outstanding under the U.S. Construction Facility bearing interest at a rate of 2.50% per annum. We made no borrowings or principal repayments on the U.S. Construction Facility during the year ended December 31, 2013.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;On August 18, 2014, we completed a private placement of $1.061 billion of senior notes bearing interest at 3.98% per annum.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; -aw-import: spaces;"&gt;&amp;#160; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;The proceeds of the private placement were used to repay the existing balance on and terminate the U.S. Construction Facility.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; -aw-import: spaces;"&gt;&amp;#160; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;We made principal payments of &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;$60.8&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;&amp;#160;million and $&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;46&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;.6 million in 202&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;5&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt; and 202&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;4&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;, respectively, and will make bi-annual payments until the final principal payment is made on June 30, 2040. Included in &amp;#8220;other deferred charges&amp;#8221; on our comparative balance sheet statement for December 31, 202&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;5&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt; and 202&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;4&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;, are &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;$&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;5&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;9&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt; million and $&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;6&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;8&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt; million, respectively, of financing costs associated with the establishment of the U.S. credit facility.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</ferc:NotesToFinancialStatementsTextBlock>
